1fdb19.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Arkulius.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>...the arithmetical paradox has the same value in a metaphysical way, then...</li><li>Oh my! Alverus!! Did you really...?!?! I have to recalculate it to make sure that I made no mistake.</li><li>&lt;mumbles&gt;</li><li>...the minimum square deviation could cause a dislocation, in a matter of fact...</li><li>...it could be possible to bring the sphere to a destination where...</li><li>Yes, that's it! The elementary particle are corresponding to the... the ... UNBELIEVEABLE!!!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Ivory Towers</a> south-eastern tower\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Arkulius is one of the Edron's scholars, trying his best to revive the mage Alverus who has been frozen by a problem in the elemental machinery.\nPart of the <a href=\"#/quest/elemental-spheres-quest\">Elemental Spheres Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikita